    "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>Fv</mi></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>Fv</mi></math>&nbsp; ( since&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math>&nbsp;)<br /><br />therefore&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">F</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>ma</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn><mo>×</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi><mfrac><mi>dv</mi><mi>dx</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><munderover><mo>∫</mo><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi></munderover><mi>dv</mi><mo>=</mo><munderover><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></munderover><mi>dx</mi></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mi>dx</mi><mi>dt</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><munderover><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></munderover><mfrac><mi>dx</mi><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><munderover><mo